    "content": "The `NEPALI_DATE_MAP` data structure contains the official calendar matrix for the Bikram Sambat system spanning years 1976 through 2100 BS. Because Bikram Sambat months have variable day counts determined by astronomical solar calculations rather than fixed rules, this mapping table provides the definitive source of truth for conversions, day calculations, and month lengths."
