    "heading": "object-schema",
    "content": "| Field  | Type       | Description                                                                                                        |\n| ------ | ---------- | ------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------ |\n| `days` | `number[]` | An array of 12 integers representing the day count of each month from Baisakh (`index 0`) to Chaitra (`index 11`). |",
