    "heading": "object-schema",
    "content": "| Field       | Type     | Description                                                                 |\n| ----------- | -------- | --------------------------------------------------------------------------- |\n| `totalDays` | `number` | Total number of days in that Bikram Sambat year (typically `365` or `366`). |",
