    "heading": "return-value",
    "content": "Zero if they are identical in the evaluated unit."
  }, {
    "heading": "calculation-rules",
    "content": "**`\"day\"`**: Computed using Unix timestamps: `Math.floor((this.getTime() - date.getTime()) / 86400000)`."
  }, {
    "heading": "calculation-rules",
    "content": "**`\"month\"`**: Computed using calendar month indices: `(this.year - date.year) * 12 + (this.month - date.month)`."
