    "heading": "parameters",
    "content": "| Parameter     | Type     | Required | Default | Description                                                                                                                      |\n| ------------- | -------- | -------- | ------- | -------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------- |\n| `startOfWeek` | `number` | No       | `0`     | Day of week index (`0-6`) that defines when the week begins. By default, `0` (Sunday) is the start, making Saturday (6) the end. |",
