  }, {
    "heading": "parameters",
    "content": "| Parameter | Type     | Required | Description                                               |\n| --------- | -------- | -------- | --------------------------------------------------------- |\n| `adDate`  | `string` | Yes      | Gregorian date string formatted strictly as `YYYY-MM-DD`. |",
