  }, {
    "heading": "exceptions",
    "content": "| Error Message                                      | Trigger Condition                                                |\n| -------------------------------------------------- | ---------------------------------------------------------------- |\n| `Invalid date format. Expected format: YYYY-MM-DD` | Thrown if `adDate` fails the format regex `^\\d{4}-\\d{2}-\\d{2}$`. |",
