    "heading": "exceptions",
    "content": "| Error Message                   | Trigger Condition                                        |\n| ------------------------------- | -------------------------------------------------------- |\n| `Invalid date input '<adDate>'` | Thrown if date values produce `NaN` (e.g. `2024-02-31`). |",
