  }, {
    "heading": "parameters",
    "content": "| Parameter | Type         | Required | Description                                      |\n| --------- | ------------ | -------- | ------------------------------------------------ |\n| `date`    | `NepaliDate` | Yes      | Target `NepaliDate` instance to compare against. |",
