    "heading": "parameters",
    "content": "| Parameter | Type                         | Required | Description                         |\n| --------- | ---------------------------- | -------- | ----------------------------------- |\n| `unit`    | `\"year\" \\| \"month\" \\| \"day\"` | Yes      | Unit of granularity for comparison. |",
