    "heading": "return-value",
    "content": "**Type**: `boolean`"
  }, {
    "heading": "return-value",
    "content": "Returns `true` if both dates are identical within the specified unit boundary; otherwise returns `false`."
  }, {
    "heading": "comparison-rules",
    "content": "**`\"year\"`**: Evaluates `this.year === date.year`."
  }, {
    "heading": "comparison-rules",
    "content": "**`\"month\"`**: Evaluates `this.year === date.year && this.month === date.month`."
  }, {
    "heading": "comparison-rules",
    "content": "**`\"day\"`**: Evaluates `this.isEqual(date)` (matching year, month, and day)."
