  "contents": [{
    "heading": undefined,
    "content": "The `getCalendarDays` static method generates a complete forty two cell grid structure representing six rows of seven days for displaying a monthly calendar view. It includes trailing days from the previous month and leading days from the next month to fill out the matrix, simplifying the creation of date pickers and visual calendar components."
  }, {
    "heading": "parameters",
    "content": "| Parameter | Type     | Required | Description                       |\n| --------- | -------- | -------- | --------------------------------- |\n| `year`    | `number` | Yes      | Bikram Sambat year (e.g. `2081`). |",
    "table": "table-0"
  }, {
    "heading": "parameters",
    "content": "| Parameter | Type     | Required | Description                                                            |\n| --------- | -------- | -------- | ---------------------------------------------------------------------- |\n| `month`   | `number` | Yes      | Zero-indexed month (`0-11`, where `0` is Baisakh and `11` is Chaitra). |",
    "table": "table-0"
  }, {
    "heading": "return-value",
    "content": "**Type**: `Object` containing calendar grid sections:"
  }, {
    "heading": "return-value",
    "content": "`prevRemainingDays`: Number of leading days from the previous month needed to reach the first day's weekday."
  }, {
    "heading": "return-value",
    "content": "`prevMonth`: Object containing `year`, `month`, and `days` array for preceding filler dates."
  }, {
    "heading": "return-value",
    "content": "`currentMonth`: Object containing `year`, `month`, and `days` array (`1` through `daysInMonth`) for the active month."
  }, {
    "heading": "return-value",
    "content": "`nextMonth`: Object containing `year`, `month`, and `days` array for succeeding filler dates to complete 42 cells."
  }, {
    "heading": "return-value",
    "content": "`remainingDays`: Number of trailing days in `nextMonth`."
  }, {
    "heading": "exceptions",
    "content": "Throws an `Error` if the year or month index is invalid:"
  }, {
    "heading": "related",
    "content": "`date.daysInMonth()`: Total number of days in the month."
  }, {
    "heading": "related",
    "content": "`date.getWeeksInMonth()`: Number of week rows needed."
  }, {
