    "content": "Thank you for your interest in contributing to the **Nepali Date (Bikram Sambat) Ecosystem**! This open-source project is built and maintained to provide synchronized, robust, zero-dependency calendar tools across JavaScript/TypeScript, Python, and PHP."
  }, {
    "heading": undefined,
    "content": "Whether you are fixing a typo, adding calendar tests, improving performance, or porting new features across languages, your contributions are warmly welcomed."
  }, {
    "heading": "ecosystem-repositories",
    "content": "The ecosystem consists of four main projects:"
