    "content": "The `BStoAD` function converts a Bikram Sambat date string into its equivalent Gregorian calendar date string. It validates the input Nepali date against verified historical calendar maps and returns a formatted Gregorian date string suitable for storage in standard SQL databases or transmission over web APIs."
