    "heading": "exceptions",
    "content": "| Error Message                                      | Trigger Condition                                                        |\n| -------------------------------------------------- | ------------------------------------------------------------------------ |\n| `Invalid date format. Expected format: YYYY-MM-DD` | Raised if input string fails the regex validation `^\\d{4}-\\d{2}-\\d{2}$`. |",
    "table": "table-1"
  }, {
    "heading": "exceptions",
    "content": "| Error Message             | Trigger Condition                                                 |\n| ------------------------- | ----------------------------------------------------------------- |\n| `Nepal year out of range` | Raised if the year is earlier than 1976 BS or later than 2100 BS. |",
    "table": "table-1"
  }, {
    "heading": "exceptions",
    "content": "| Error Message          | Trigger Condition                                   |\n| ---------------------- | --------------------------------------------------- |\n| `Invalid Nepali month` | Raised if the month number is not between 1 and 12. |",
    "table": "table-1"
  }, {
    "heading": "exceptions",
    "content": "| Error Message         | Trigger Condition                                                               |\n| --------------------- | ------------------------------------------------------------------------------- |\n| `Invalid Nepali date` | Raised if the day number exceeds the actual days in that specific Nepali month. |",
