    "heading": "timezone-drift-prevention",
    "content": "`\"2024-11-01\"` is always resolved at `2024-11-01T00:00:00.000Z`."
  }, {
    "heading": "timezone-drift-prevention",
    "content": "Conversions produce identical results regardless of whether your code runs in Tokyo (UTC+9), Kathmandu (UTC+5:45), London (UTC+0), or San Francisco (UTC-8)."
  }, {
    "heading": "input-format-standard",
    "content": "Both conversion functions enforce the ISO-8601 standard date format:"
  }, {
    "heading": "input-format-standard",
    "content": "Years must be 4 digits."
  }, {
    "heading": "input-format-standard",
    "content": "Months must be 2 zero-padded digits (`01` to `12`)."
  }, {
    "heading": "input-format-standard",
    "content": "Days must be 2 zero-padded digits (`01` to `32`)."
  }, {
